/*
===============================================================================
DDL Script: Create Bronze Tables
===============================================================================
Script Purpose:
    This script defines the 'Bronze Layer' (Raw Data) structure. 
    It drops existing tables and recreates them using a 'VARCHAR' strategy.
    
    Why VARCHAR? 
    The MySQL Table Data Import Wizard is strict. To prevent row-loss 
    due to empty cells, trailing spaces, or date formatting (slashes vs dashes), 
    we import all data as strings first and clean them in the Silver Layer.
===============================================================================
*/

Use DataWarehouse_Bronze;

/* SQL Server & mySQL difference
for SQL Server
IF OBJECT_ID('bronze.erp_px_cat_g1v2', 'U') IS NOT NULL
DROP TABLE bronze.erp_px_cat_g1v2;

for mySQL
DROP TABLE IF EXISTS crm_cust_info;
*/

